---
import MainGridLayout from "../layouts/MainGridLayout.astro";
import { url } from "../utils/url-utils";
---
<MainGridLayout title="找不到這一頁" noindex>
  <section class="card-base empty-state">
    <p class="eyebrow">404 · LOST AT SEA</p>
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold mt-4">這一頁游到別處了</h1>
    <p>連結可能已失效，或文章已經搬家。從文章探索重新出發吧。</p>
    <div class="flex gap-3 justify-center"><a class="tool-button" href={url("/")}>返回首頁</a><a class="tool-button" href={url("/archive/")}>探索文章 →</a></div>
  </section>
</MainGridLayout>

